The temporal encoder uses ConvTran-based positional and relative attention.
The optical-flow front-end uses EVFlowNet. Comparison architectures include
VideoMAE and SpikingResformer. External packages and camera SDKs retain their
respective licenses and terms.

The positional-encoding implementation in nlidnet/models/baselines/videomae.py
references:
https://github.com/jadore801120/attention-is-all-you-need-pytorch/blob/master/transformer/Models.py#L31

Acquisition software, the liquid-property reference table and platform figures
are shared with NLID:
https://github.com/wyl-OvO/NLID

